{ dg-modules "genietransput" }
{ Rosetta Code, task "Flow-control structures", ALGOL 68 solution flow-control-structures-2.alg.
  https://rosettacode.org/wiki/Flow-control_structures#ALGOL_68
  The text of Rosetta Code is available under the GNU Free Documentation
  License 1.3 (see README.md).  The solution is unchanged in orig/flow-control-structures-2.a68;
  this copy was prepared for ga68 and converted to SUPPER stropping by
  tools/rosetta_prep.py. }
access Genie_Transput (
string medal = (
  []proc void award = (gold,silver,bronze);

  award[ 1 + ENTIER (random*3)];

  gold: "Gold" exit
  silver: "Silver" exit
  bronze: "Bronze"

);

print(("Medal awarded: ",medal, new_line));
)
